  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter export controls and vetting on advanced components (e.g., semiconductors, sensors) in the context of US–China tech scrutiny reduce the availability of dual‑use parts routed through third parties to Russia, degrading spare‑parts throughput and sustainment of Russian field logistics.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
