  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Escalation of kinetic operations generates new sanctions, cyber reprisals and intelligence warnings that harden strategic perceptions and cause the US to treat advanced technology ties as security vulnerabilities, raising bilateral tech tensions with China.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
