  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Interruptions and price spikes in fuel and electricity raise operating costs and execution risk for compute‑intensive AI projects, reducing investor returns and leading to a near‑term pullback or reallocation of capital away from AI deployments in impacted markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
