  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Diversion and depletion of Western and partner logistics/supply lines to sustain operations for the Russia–Ukraine war reduces patrols, maintenance and on‑station time for Gulf naval and air assets, lowering deterrence and enabling an uptick in IRGC/proxy missile, drone and sabotage attacks on ships and facilities.</data>
