  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Visible breakdowns or bottlenecks in military logistics tied to foreign‑sourced components accelerate policymaker urgency and produce faster legislative and administrative initiatives aimed at securing tech supply chains, increasing momentum for regulatory change.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
