  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising 10‑year sovereign yields increase long‑term financing costs and lower the present value of expected returns, prompting firms to scale back investment and delay recruitment for new projects, reducing hiring rates.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
