  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising 10‑year yields increase the cost of carrying inventories and hedging for oil traders and raise financing strains for exporters, prompting market participants to add a larger geopolitical risk premium to Middle East energy exposure.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_monetary_tighteni</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_maritime_tensi</data>
