  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising 10-year sovereign yields increase projected debt-service costs and fiscal strain for donor governments, reducing political appetite and fiscal room for multiyear coordinated security commitments and large procurement programs for Ukraine support.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_monetary_tighteni</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
