  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in cross‑border capital inflows (FDI and portfolio funding) supports business expansion and vacancy creation in recipient economies, tightening the labor market (more vacancies per worker) over the medium term.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_monetary_tighteni</data>
  <data key="d39">euro_security_realignmen</data>
