  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp cross‑border capital outflows reduce available credit for shipowners, ports and insurers in the Gulf, causing idled vessels, reduced security patrols and rerouting that materially increase the severity of shipping disruptions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_monetary_tighteni</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_maritime_tensi</data>
