  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden reduction in cross-border capital and FX flows impairs suppliers' ability to pay for imported components, credit lines and logistics services denominated in hard currency, directly disrupting deliveries of ammunition, parts and fuel to operations in Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_monetary_tighteni</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
