  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher hiring rates in European manufacturing and defense contractors increase production capacity and labor available for munitions, spare parts and transport operations, raising throughput and reliability of military logistics to forces supporting Ukraine.</data>
